526
00:33:40,869 --> 00:33:42,079
I actually prefer it this way.

527
00:33:45,207 --> 00:33:46,792
You're so straightforward.

528
00:33:47,626 --> 00:33:49,795
You don't hold back at all.

529
00:33:50,837 --> 00:33:51,964
I've never been good

530
00:33:52,172 --> 00:33:54,800
at calculating my feelings.

531
00:33:54,883 --> 00:33:56,260
If I like someone, I just go for it.

532
00:33:57,844 --> 00:33:59,012
Remember what we said about us?

533
00:33:59,304 --> 00:34:01,306
We go all in.

534
00:34:05,686 --> 00:34:07,354
I've been thinking...

535
00:34:08,272 --> 00:34:09,565
I don't think that's me.

536
00:34:10,107 --> 00:34:13,527
I've never poured my everything in

537
00:34:13,610 --> 00:34:17,114
without weighing
the pros and cons like you.

538
00:34:18,865 --> 00:34:20,117
I always chicken out

539
00:34:20,492 --> 00:34:24,496
at the last second.

540
00:34:40,596 --> 00:34:41,847
<i>What are they doing here?</i>

541
00:35:07,164 --> 00:35:08,874
INCOMING CALL
GONG NAM-SU

542
00:35:11,043 --> 00:35:13,003
- Hello?
- Hi, Dal.

543
00:35:13,503 --> 00:35:14,755
How's it going?

544
00:35:15,172 --> 00:35:16,381
Why the sudden call?

545
00:35:16,465 --> 00:35:18,925
I just called to hear your voice.

546
00:35:20,719 --> 00:35:23,305
Actually, I'm a little confused.

547
00:35:24,181 --> 00:35:26,350
My girlfriend posted a picture
of dumplings on her social media.

548
00:35:26,433 --> 00:35:27,893
What do you think that means?

549
00:35:27,976 --> 00:35:30,646
Is she craving them
or did she already eat them?

550
00:35:30,729 --> 00:35:32,105
I bought some just in case.

551
00:35:33,690 --> 00:35:37,444
Are you asking me
to decode a pregnant woman's mind?

552
00:35:37,944 --> 00:35:41,365
I figured you'd understand women
better than I do.

553
00:35:41,782 --> 00:35:43,158
I have no idea either...

554
00:35:45,619 --> 00:35:47,621
- what women think.
<i>- Let's say</i>

555
00:35:47,996 --> 00:35:51,166
<i>my sister posts a picture</i>
<i>of seed </i>hotteok <i>on her social media.</i>

556
00:35:51,833 --> 00:35:53,043
<i>Would you buy it for her?</i>

557
00:35:53,543 --> 00:35:56,254
Does she like seed <i>hotteok?</i>

558
00:35:56,880 --> 00:35:57,881
Yes.

559
00:36:04,971 --> 00:36:07,933
One thing's for sure.
The romance is gone.

560
00:36:09,017 --> 00:36:12,437
- I'm sorry?
- I know your job, name, and age.

561
00:36:14,064 --> 00:36:16,441
I know your job, name, and age too.

562
00:36:16,525 --> 00:36:19,152
You probably think
this is embarrassing for you

563
00:36:19,236 --> 00:36:20,529
but you're wrong.

564
00:36:20,612 --> 00:36:22,114
I'm the best instructor
in this field.

565
00:36:22,197 --> 00:36:23,865
Do you have any idea
how I feel right now?

566
00:36:23,949 --> 00:36:26,993
How do you think the student feels
after trying so hard only to fail?

567
00:36:27,369 --> 00:36:30,038
Since it turned out like this,
let's give it another shot.

568
00:36:30,122 --> 00:36:32,249
Who cares if it takes
two or three tries?

569
00:36:33,083 --> 00:36:35,210
- What do you say?
- To be honest...

570
00:36:38,130 --> 00:36:39,381
I have a bit of trauma.

571
00:36:45,512 --> 00:36:47,264
I knew you'd say that.

572
00:36:48,348 --> 00:36:49,516
Look at me.

573
00:36:49,599 --> 00:36:51,727
I'll cure you right at once,
so listen up.

574
00:36:52,644 --> 00:36:53,729
What I prefer

575
00:36:54,980 --> 00:36:56,148
isn't this.

576
00:36:57,065 --> 00:36:58,442
This is what counts.

577
00:36:58,525 --> 00:37:01,403
- What matters is an undying...
- I think

578
00:37:01,486 --> 00:37:02,487
I'm fully healed.

579
00:37:04,990 --> 00:37:06,950
- Let's go.
- Yes, ma'am.

580
00:37:19,629 --> 00:37:21,339
Wow, you're good.

581
00:37:22,716 --> 00:37:24,676
My reflexes aren't too bad, right?

582
00:37:26,344 --> 00:37:27,345
You should give it a try.

583
00:37:49,826 --> 00:37:51,703
Were you on the baseball team
or something?

584
00:37:51,787 --> 00:37:55,207
Oh, I just played a lot of tipcat
with my grandpa as a kid.

585
00:37:55,957 --> 00:37:57,042
Tipcat?

586
00:37:58,710 --> 00:38:01,713
Taking a few swings
really helped me blow off some steam.

587
00:38:13,308 --> 00:38:14,559
Thanks.

588
00:38:20,106 --> 00:38:21,274
Ms. Gong.

589
00:38:22,150 --> 00:38:23,985
I have a question for you.

590
00:38:25,487 --> 00:38:27,906
Why did you say yes
to a date with me?

591
00:38:29,908 --> 00:38:33,411
What woman would turn down a date

592
00:38:33,703 --> 00:38:35,288
with a great guy like you?

593
00:38:37,123 --> 00:38:39,334
You're understanding and sweet.

594
00:38:39,417 --> 00:38:41,503
You're caring to those around you.

595
00:38:42,379 --> 00:38:44,172
You're respectful to elders too.

596
00:38:45,632 --> 00:38:47,175
You're the perfect package.

597
00:38:48,844 --> 00:38:50,595
Simply because I'm a great guy?

598
00:38:53,431 --> 00:38:54,724
What about you, then?

599
00:38:57,477 --> 00:38:58,895
Because I like you.

600
00:39:01,439 --> 00:39:03,942
I find
your occasional clumsiness cute.

601
00:39:04,442 --> 00:39:06,820
And I admire how firmly
you draw the line when needed.

602
00:39:08,738 --> 00:39:10,365
I love all those things about you

603
00:39:11,157 --> 00:39:12,659
simply because it's you.

604
00:39:16,288 --> 00:39:17,414
Ms. Gong.

605
00:39:18,915 --> 00:39:21,001
Can I go all in on you?

606
00:39:50,739 --> 00:39:52,866
This definitely needs some oiling.

607
00:39:58,663 --> 00:39:59,789
There...

608
00:39:59,873 --> 00:40:02,250
There's a mosquito.

609
00:40:03,919 --> 00:40:06,212
You're not allergic
to mosquito bites, are you?

610
00:40:06,296 --> 00:40:08,590
No, I'm fine.

611
00:40:13,303 --> 00:40:15,555
Should we get going?

612
00:40:15,639 --> 00:40:17,974
I'm supposed to meet up with Se-ra.

613
00:40:18,058 --> 00:40:19,768
Let me head back first.

614
00:40:20,268 --> 00:40:22,354
Oh, of course.
You'd better get going, then.

615
00:40:23,647 --> 00:40:24,856
See you later.

616
00:40:37,744 --> 00:40:39,579
If only this bench
hadn't ruined the mood...

617
00:41:14,489 --> 00:41:15,865
Hey.

618
00:41:16,825 --> 00:41:18,451
Can you buy me a drink?

619
00:41:18,535 --> 00:41:21,413
<i>Sorry, Yeon-su.</i>
<i>I'm kind of busy right now.</i>

620
00:41:21,621 --> 00:41:22,998
<i>Stop it!</i>

621
00:41:25,917 --> 00:41:28,128
<i>Sorry. Order room service.</i>

622
00:41:28,211 --> 00:41:31,381
<i>- Get the expensive wine. It's on me.</i>
- Okay.

623
00:42:07,333 --> 00:42:08,543
Want some?

624
00:42:16,718 --> 00:42:18,970
Why are you alone, though?

625
00:42:23,016 --> 00:42:24,225
We just

626
00:42:24,309 --> 00:42:26,770
grabbed dinner and called it a night.

627
00:42:29,773 --> 00:42:30,774
I see.

628
00:42:35,153 --> 00:42:36,279
You said you had dinner.

629
00:42:38,656 --> 00:42:41,367
This is dessert.

630
00:43:00,178 --> 00:43:01,554
I don't think

631
00:43:02,180 --> 00:43:04,224
you need to change rooms.

632
00:43:05,809 --> 00:43:07,185
Too much luggage to move anyway.

633
00:43:08,186 --> 00:43:09,562
I don't mind.

634
00:43:11,564 --> 00:43:12,607
I see.

635
00:44:08,037 --> 00:44:11,291
What I like?

636
00:44:54,542 --> 00:44:55,668
What the...

637
00:46:36,811 --> 00:46:38,021
Who is it?

638
00:46:41,274 --> 00:46:42,567
Who is it?

639
00:46:42,650 --> 00:46:44,610
Yeon-su, it's me.

640
00:46:45,820 --> 00:46:47,113
Seung-jun?

641
00:46:50,366 --> 00:46:51,701
Surprise.

642
00:46:53,786 --> 00:46:55,246
What are you doing here at this hour?

643
00:46:55,330 --> 00:46:58,624
I came to tell you something.

644
00:47:00,084 --> 00:47:02,378
It's late. Let's talk tomorrow.

645
00:47:03,338 --> 00:47:05,340
Wait. Hold on.

646
00:47:05,715 --> 00:47:07,759
It has to be today.

647
00:47:07,842 --> 00:47:11,763
Right now
while I'm actually feeling it.

648
00:47:12,764 --> 00:47:13,848
What's wrong with you?

649
00:47:13,931 --> 00:47:16,642
I really need to tell you something.

650
00:47:16,726 --> 00:47:19,771
Can you take the chain off
for a second?

651
00:47:21,272 --> 00:47:22,482
Come on.

652
00:47:25,526 --> 00:47:27,195
- Get your foot away.
- Oh, okay.

653
00:47:31,491 --> 00:47:33,326
- What is it?
- Yeon-su.

654
00:47:34,702 --> 00:47:36,454
Let me ask you one thing first.

655
00:47:38,998 --> 00:47:40,917
Do you still have feelings for me?

656
00:47:42,043 --> 00:47:44,629
- Not this again.
- No, seriously.

657
00:47:45,254 --> 00:47:48,508
If you're working with my company,
we'll be seeing each other often.

658
00:47:48,591 --> 00:47:51,761
This is incredibly important
to me, okay?

659
00:47:52,720 --> 00:47:54,013
Please answer me.

660
00:47:54,097 --> 00:47:56,641
I don't. Not even one percent.

661
00:47:56,974 --> 00:47:58,393
Are we clear? Now go.

662
00:47:58,476 --> 00:48:01,145
- Wait. Hold on a second.
- Jeez.

663
00:48:01,229 --> 00:48:03,898
- Hold on.
- What's wrong with you?

664
00:48:08,528 --> 00:48:10,571
I genuinely loved you.

665
00:48:13,908 --> 00:48:14,909
That's why

666
00:48:16,285 --> 00:48:17,912
I want to apologize.

667
00:48:19,414 --> 00:48:22,083
I'm so sorry
for treating you selfishly

668
00:48:22,625 --> 00:48:24,710
and doing things my way.

669
00:48:30,216 --> 00:48:32,009
- Yeon-su.
- Let go.

670
00:48:32,093 --> 00:48:34,887
- Hold on.
- I said let go.

671
00:48:35,304 --> 00:48:37,849
- Let go of me!
- I'm getting married.

672
00:48:40,268 --> 00:48:41,561
What?

673
00:48:41,978 --> 00:48:43,938
You're getting what?

674
00:48:44,272 --> 00:48:45,314
I'm going to be

675
00:48:46,482 --> 00:48:47,525
a dad.

676
00:48:49,777 --> 00:48:50,987
It just happened.

677
00:48:51,279 --> 00:48:54,198
Shocked, right? Me too.

678
00:48:54,282 --> 00:48:55,450
You know how people say

679
00:48:55,533 --> 00:48:57,452
everyone has the one
they're meant to marry.

680
00:48:57,535 --> 00:48:59,078
Turns out, it's true.

681
00:48:59,162 --> 00:49:01,622
Who knew I'd do it
with a girl I met two months ago

682
00:49:01,706 --> 00:49:04,375
when we couldn't do it
in a year and a half?

683
00:49:06,002 --> 00:49:07,628
But the crazy thing is

684
00:49:09,213 --> 00:49:11,507
with her,
I feel some sort of certainty.

685
00:49:13,843 --> 00:49:15,678
- Certainty?
- Yes.

686
00:49:16,929 --> 00:49:19,599
I know it's shameless of me

687
00:49:19,682 --> 00:49:21,267
but I'd love
a sincere blessing from you.

688
00:49:32,069 --> 00:49:34,405
PLEASE COME
AND GIVE US YOUR BLESSINGS

689
00:49:34,489 --> 00:49:36,949
WEDDING INVITATION

690
00:50:15,530 --> 00:50:17,907
- Yes?
- Are you okay?

691
00:50:26,165 --> 00:50:27,333
I'm sorry.

692
00:50:28,084 --> 00:50:30,378
Did I wake you up?

693
00:50:32,046 --> 00:50:33,047
I asked if you're okay.

694
00:50:34,840 --> 00:50:37,468
You heard everything, didn't you?

695
00:50:43,015 --> 00:50:44,392
Of course, I'm fine.

696
00:50:45,685 --> 00:50:47,019
It's just...

697
00:50:47,770 --> 00:50:48,980
How should I put it?

698
00:50:51,816 --> 00:50:53,067
Funny.

699
00:50:54,986 --> 00:50:57,071
A year and a half

700
00:50:57,822 --> 00:51:00,408
lost out to two months.

701
00:51:02,034 --> 00:51:03,286
That gave me a reality check.

702
00:51:06,163 --> 00:51:09,625
The only difference is
that we didn't sleep together.

703
00:51:10,668 --> 00:51:11,961
That's literally the only thing.

704
00:51:13,421 --> 00:51:16,799
Do you regret not sleeping with him?

705
00:51:17,800 --> 00:51:18,801
No.

706
00:51:19,719 --> 00:51:21,095
But strangely enough...

707
00:51:24,098 --> 00:51:27,685
for the first time,
I think I finally get how he feels.

708
00:51:32,398 --> 00:51:35,818
I dated him for a year and a half

709
00:51:36,944 --> 00:51:40,156
and never once wanted
to sleep with him.

710
00:51:41,991 --> 00:51:43,159
Yet...

711
00:51:47,622 --> 00:51:50,625
I can't stop thinking
about my kiss with you

712
00:51:51,125 --> 00:51:52,501
when I've barely known you
for two months.

713
00:51:59,884 --> 00:52:00,926
So I've decided

714
00:52:02,345 --> 00:52:05,139
to start being honest with myself.

715
00:53:56,292 --> 00:53:59,920
MAKE ME TINGLE

716
00:55:34,473 --> 00:55:36,433
Subtitles by Songmi You
and Eunjin Erica Kim
